# Monthly performance feedback — the 5th / 6th / 7th cycle. CFO 2026-08-26/27.
#
# Botswana is UTC+2, so subtract 2 hours from local time.
#   5th 07:00 UTC = 09:00 local — ONE email per manager, the whole team's month
#                                already written up. Confirm, edit, or ignore.
#   6th 07:00 UTC = 09:00 local — last reminder.
#   7th 15:00 UTC = 17:00 local — auto-post, end of day, unrated.
#
# The auto-post refuses to run for any manager who did not get BOTH the draft
# AND the reminder (CFO 2026-08-27), so a failed mail run delays the post rather
# than recording an innocent manager as silent. All three commands are
# idempotent per (manager, period) — a double run cannot double-mail or
# double-post. Clock UTC.
#
# Drop into /etc/cron.d/ via infra/install-crons.sh (editing this file alone
# schedules nothing on the host).
SHELL=/bin/bash
PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin
# CFO 2026-09-09 moved the cycle. It used to be 5th / 6th / auto-post 7th, which
# gave a manager barely a day between the reminder and the post. Now:
#   2nd  the facts go to the manager  ("the facts about the staff who report to you")
#   4th  reminder to the manager AND to the staff member it is about
#   7th  second reminder to both
#   10th auto-posted if nothing came back
0 7 2 * *  root cd /opt/alpha-finance && /usr/bin/docker compose --env-file /etc/alpha-finance/.env exec -T backend python manage.py monthly_feedback_notice --commit >> /var/log/alpha-finance/monthly-feedback.log 2>&1
0 7 4 * *  root cd /opt/alpha-finance && /usr/bin/docker compose --env-file /etc/alpha-finance/.env exec -T backend python manage.py monthly_feedback_notice --commit --reminder >> /var/log/alpha-finance/monthly-feedback.log 2>&1
0 7 7 * *  root cd /opt/alpha-finance && /usr/bin/docker compose --env-file /etc/alpha-finance/.env exec -T backend python manage.py monthly_feedback_notice --commit --final >> /var/log/alpha-finance/monthly-feedback.log 2>&1
0 15 10 * * root cd /opt/alpha-finance && /usr/bin/docker compose --env-file /etc/alpha-finance/.env exec -T backend python manage.py monthly_feedback_autopost --commit >> /var/log/alpha-finance/monthly-feedback.log 2>&1
